          9
        ],
        "kind": "d20",
        "label": "Read the Parkway",
        "nudged": false,
        "rewound": false,
        "tier": "success"
      },
      "scene": "a2_parkway",
      "t": 1791924853924
    },
    {
      "choice": "Stop. The barricade at 20th. A kid is pinned against it. Help her first.",
      "ep": "s01e10",
      "scene": "a2_freeze",
      "t": 1791924904107
    },
    {
      "choice": "Don't argue. Get up. Get the handlers back on the ropes yourself, one by one.",
      "ep": "s01e10",
      "scene": "a3_teddy",
      "t": 1791924939890
    },
    {
      "choice": "Go at the one with the tablet. Take it. Take him down.",
      "ep": "s01e10",
      "roll": {
        "dice": [
          4,
          6,
          8,
          7
        ],
        "kind": "pool",
        "label": "Take the tablet",
        "nudged": false,
        "rewound": false,
        "tier": "success"
      },
      "scene": "a3_darts",
      "t": 1791924976440
    },
    {
      "choice": "Both. Slip. You know what's waiting in there. Do it anyway.",
      "ep": "s01e10",
      "scene": "a3_choice",
      "t": 1791925045142
    },
    {
      "choice": "Kiss her. On a wall by the river, in front of a goose, with blood on both your faces.",
      "ep": "s01e10",
